Hi folks! 
We are happy to announce that update for Devoid of Shadows is available for English, Russian, Portuguese Br. and  Chinese Traditional versions.
Update for other languages will be as they bacome available.

The update brings the following major changes to the game:

Completely redesigned pathfinding system, both for heroes, and for monsters;
Added hotkeys;
Added new animations for heroes;
Improved battle system;
Arches on the levels become transparent when the characters come under them;
Added a marker for the point where the hero is going (green, if you can get to the point, red if you can't);
Added a cursor to collect loot at the level;
In the English version, the translation of dialogues and in-game texts is replaced;
Improved game balance;
Fixed some bugs;

